# Run one model from models.yaml on the latest color frame (or on a file when
# image_source is set). Served by cobot_detector (C++ / ONNX Runtime). Pixel
# space only.
#
# model_id is a leaf key of models.yaml (runtime: or calibration: section).
# Rejected (not aborted) when: unknown model_id, no color frame yet (only
# without image_source), image_source does not exist, or a detection is
# already running. The model is lazy-loaded on first use unless listed in the
# detector's `preload` parameter.
string model_id
string image_source              # container path of an image file to run on
                                 # instead of the latest camera frame; "" = live
                                 # frame. Aborted if the file cannot be decoded.
                                 # header.stamp of the result is then now().
---
bool success
string message                   # why not (inference error / canceled)
ObbDetectionArray detections     # header.stamp = the color frame the model ran on
float32 inference_ms             # session.Run() only, excludes pre/post-processing
---
string stage                     # loading_model | preprocess | inference | postprocess
